= Electoral Committee

- @electoral_reports: Collect return and interference reports
- @electoral_case: Prepare constitutional petitions

@electoral_reports
on-arrival: political_intelligence += 5; organizational_reach += 3; independent_nationalists_organization += 2
go-to: post_event

@electoral_case
on-arrival: constitutional_legitimacy += 4; parliamentary_procedure_legitimacy += 3; iran_party_relation += 2
go-to: post_event
